OL,3,GNEWSAThe museum ensuring that we shall
OL,4,Aremember them
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnce a year we promise ourselves to
OL,7,Fremember them and help their memory
OL,8,Flive on.
OL,10,FOn Remembrance Sunday, the country
OL,11,Fhonours those who died while serving in
OL,12,Fthe armed forces.
OL,14,FIn Woodstock, the Soldiers of
OL,15,FOxfordshire Museum (SOFO) is home to
OL,16,Fexhibitions, memorabilia, archives and
OL,17,Fstories that reflect the breadth of the
OL,18,Fcounty's military history.
